    "#print axioms lists p.f.meaning_eq or p.f.fixed",
    "toSpec b or slotsFrom b 4097 s inside a goal closed by rfl or unification",
    "a local definition introduced by set that omega or rw unfolds",
    "every case of a theorem over a parser that matches the opcode and the operands in one match runs out of heartbeats",
